# Agent Behavior & Rules (Backend Repo)

## Documentation
- **ALWAYS** update `DEV_LOG.md` before committing significant code, configuration, or behavior changes. Include the problem, cause, solution, and validation in the same commit when applicable.

## Terminal & Shell (PowerShell)
- **DO NOT use `&&`** chaining in Windows PowerShell commands. Use `;` instead.

## Code Quality
- Keep backend changes focused and preserve existing public APIs unless the task requires otherwise.
- Use Spanish for comments and development log entries when practical.